data: {"id":"gen-1794249896-9hNniZQseHPFbMwSjuvn","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1794249896,"model":"google/gemini-2.5-flash","provider":"Google AI Studio","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","reasoning":"**Assessing System Interconnectivity**\n\nI'm now diving into the system's interconnectivity. I've noted the Orchestrator's consistent interaction with the WebSurfer and the delegation to the Assistant. I'm focusing on the efficiency of these interactions and any potential bottlenecks. The Orchestrator's ability to detect loops and re-route tasks to the Assistant is a positive sign. However, WebSurfer's struggles with precise instruction interpretation and task execution are concerning. The system's ability to adapt and the Assistant's problem-solving appear robust, but the WebSurfer seems to be a current point of friction. I'll need to consider this in how I evaluate System Scalability.\n\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"**Assessing System Interconnectivity**\n\nI'm now diving into the system's interconnectivity. I've noted the Orchestrator's consistent interaction with the WebSurfer and the delegation to the Assistant. I'm focusing on the efficiency of these interactions and any potential bottlenecks. The Orchestrator's ability to detect loops and re-route tasks to the Assistant is a positive sign. However, WebSurfer's struggles with precise instruction interpretation and task execution are concerning. The system's ability to adapt and the Assistant's problem-solving appear robust, but the WebSurfer seems to be a current point of friction. I'll need to consider this in how I evaluate System Scalability.\n\n\n","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

